{
  "_about": "Design tokens, version 2 (DESIGN-2.md section 2). Successor of tokens.json version 1; T8.1 renames this file to tokens.json and teaches docs/design/gen-tokens.py the schema below. Until then gen-tokens.py keeps reading the version 1 file, which is unchanged.",
  "_schema": [
    "version: 2.",
    "skinOrder: the four skin ids, in the order the generator writes them.",
    "colorGroups: section numbers and titles for the comment blocks (2.1 to 2.4 as version 1, 2.5 to 2.7 new).",
    "base.colors: every colour token with its metadata {hex, group, qss, use, source?}; the hex values are the D-05 skin.",
    "base.type: every type role {weight, size, spacing, case, colour, lineHeight, usedFor[, cells]}; same rules as version 1.",
    "base.switches, base.components, base.strings: per-skin settings with the D-05 values.",
    "skins.<id>: {model, engine?, colors, type, switches, components, strings}. Each map holds only overrides.",
    "colors overrides are name -> \"#RRGGBB\"; type overrides are name -> partial role object, merged field by field.",
    "Resolution: resolved(skin).X[name] = skins[skin].X[name] if present else base.X[name]. Every override name must exist in base.",
    "skins.d05 is empty in every map: the D-05 skin is base, which equals tokens.json version 1 for every version 1 name.",
    "font, webColors, webType, breakpoints, size: unchanged from version 1 and describe the D-05 skin and the web only.",
    "geometry: LED readout numbers in units of P; not emitted to CSS."
  ],
